@startuml
hide empty description
left to right direction
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 80
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam NoteFontSize 12
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #C8E6C9
  BorderColor #7A7A7A
  ArrowColor #555555
}
title PolyNTU dialog map (initial)

state "Main window" as Main #F5F5F5 {
  state "Markets" as Markets
  state "Market page" as MarketPage
  state "Portfolio" as Portfolio
  state "Publish a market" as Create

  Markets : **UC-5**\nhero, category filter, live market cards\nhistory tabs: Closed / Voided / Resolved\nfilter, tab and page changes stay on this screen
  MarketPage : **UC-18, UC-19, UC-20, UC-21, UC-14, UC-17**\nprobabilities and market facts, trade panel\nprice and volume chart, day probability view\nseries facts, live brackets, bracket history\ncreator resolve control [authority = creator]
  Portfolio : **UC-4, UC-15**\noutcome shares, settlement credits, trade history\nsigned out: "Sign in to view your positions"
  Create : **UC-8, UC-9, UC-10, UC-11**\none-time or recurring form\nresolution authority, fee, schedule

  ' --- in-screen actions ---
  Markets --> MarketPage : select a market card
  Portfolio --> MarketPage : select a market title
  MarketPage --> MarketPage : select another bracket\n(Trade / View)
  MarketPage --> Markets : "← All markets"\n[opened from Markets]
  MarketPage --> Portfolio : "← All markets"\n[opened from Portfolio]
  Create --> MarketPage : publish succeeds\n[a bracket already spawned]
  Create --> Markets : publish succeeds\n[no bracket yet], or "← All markets"

  ' --- header navigation, available on every screen ---
  Markets -[#1565C0]-> Portfolio : Portfolio tab
  Markets -[#1565C0]-> Create : Create market tab\n[role = creator]
  Portfolio -[#1565C0]-> Markets : Markets tab / wordmark
  Portfolio -[#1565C0]-> Create : Create market tab\n[role = creator]
  Create -[#1565C0]-> Markets : Markets tab / wordmark
  Create -[#1565C0]-> Portfolio : Portfolio tab
  MarketPage -[#1565C0]-> Markets : Markets tab / wordmark
  MarketPage -[#1565C0]-> Portfolio : Portfolio tab
  MarketPage -[#1565C0]-> Create : Create market tab\n[role = creator]

  Create -[#E65100]-> Markets : Sign out\n(proposed fix)
}

[*] --> Markets : open the app\n(Visitor, not signed in)

state "Account access dialog" as Access #F5F5F5 {
  state "Register" as Register
  state "Log in" as Login
  state "Demo accounts" as Demo #FFF9C4

  Register : **UC-1, UC-3**\ndisplay name, NTU email,\npassword (12 characters or more)\nsuccess: the account opens with the\n10,000-unit welcome gift
  Login : **UC-2**\nNTU email, password
  Demo : disclosure inside the dialog:\none-click participant, bus creator, administrator

  Register --> Login : "Log in"
  Login --> Register : "Create account"
  Register --> Demo : expand "Demo accounts"\n[demo mode]
  Login --> Demo : expand "Demo accounts"\n[demo mode]
  Register --> Register : rejected: non-NTU email, duplicate,\nshort password (error banner)
  Login --> Login : wrong credentials\n(error banner)
}

state "Demo clock dialog" as Clock #FFF9C4
Clock : administrator token\nAdvance 1 hour / Advance 1 day

Main --> Register : "Create account"\n[not signed in]
Main --> Login : "Log in"\n[not signed in]
Access --> Main : sign-in succeeds (session opens)\nor close: x, Esc, backdrop, same header\nbutton again (still signed out)\nthe screen underneath is unchanged

Main --> Clock : footer "Demo clock"\n[demo mode]
Clock --> Main : close: x, Esc, backdrop
Clock --> Clock : Advance 1 hour / 1 day\n[administrator token entered]

note top of Main
  **Present on every screen**
  Header: wordmark, Markets, Portfolio,
  Create market [role = creator], and either
  Create account / Log in or the account chip
  with Sign out. Sign out ends the session and
  keeps the current screen.

  Error banner: any failed request, dismissible.

  Pending-trade banner: "Resume trade" opens the
  saved trade's Market page from any screen.

  Creator verification panel [role = member]
  (**UC-6**): Request verification -> pending ->
  approved (the Create market tab appears) or
  rejected -> Apply again.

  Sign out (**UC-25**) ends the session from the
  account chip.
end note

note bottom of Clock
  **Use cases with no screen**
  UC-7 (approve or reject a creator request),
  UC-22 (suspend an instance), UC-23 (grant units)
  and UC-24 (run reconciliation) are administrator
  work and run through the API only; an admin
  console is a candidate for the next iteration.

  UC-12, UC-13, UC-15, UC-16 and UC-17 belong to
  the Scheduler and Settlement Worker. They have no
  screen by design; their results surface on the
  Market page and in the portfolio.
end note

note bottom of Markets
  **UC-5 is named "Browse and search markets"**
  but this screen offers category filters and
  paging only; there is no search control.
  Either add one or rename the use case.
end note

legend right
  Green: screen or dialog in the current build
  Yellow: demo-mode fixture, not a requirement
  Blue arrow: header navigation, available on every screen
  Grey arrow: action inside the current screen
  Orange arrow: proposed change (Sign out on Publish
  leaves an empty screen in the current build)
end legend
@enduml
